This recipe (scripts, tools and documents) is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

It contains no model weights and no third-party source code. Its kit/ folder holds compiled kernels: our own, and
PyTorch's attention kernel for the vision tower, unmodified, in binary form; kit/KIT-LICENSES.md gives each file's
source and license and kit/LICENSES/ holds the license texts. It runs, or was built with reference to, the third-party
work below. ATTRIBUTION.md says what was taken from each one and how.

TensorFold
  Copyright 2026 TensorFold contributors. Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold
  The serving engine. Our engine for this model is branch deepseek-v41-zig-tp4 of our fork
  (https://github.com/bertholomus/TensorFold), which keeps TensorFold's LICENSE and upstream license texts, lists the
  upstream files it changes in its NOTICE and every outside source in its ATTRIBUTION.md.

DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash
  Copyright (c) 2023 DeepSeek. MIT License (inference code and weights).
  https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash
  The model. Its inference code and tech report were read for the model math. No code was copied. The original
  shards 47 and 48 (Engram tables) are loaded at run time and not included here. The gates' bias_vl tensors are made
  into kit/vision/gate_bias_vl.safetensors by kit/tools/make_bias_vl.py; git does not hold that file.

DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-EXL3-2.9bpw
  EXL3 quantization by Mia-AiLab. MIT License, inherited from the base model.
  https://huggingface.co/Mia-AiLab/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-EXL3-2.9bpw
  The weights the engine serves. Not included here.

NVIDIA PyTorch container (PyTorch, Triton, NCCL, Pillow)
  Used at run time as supplied by NVIDIA (nvcr.io/nvidia/pytorch:26.07-py3), under NVIDIA's own license and the
  components' licenses. Not redistributed here, except the one PyTorch kernel below.

